<title>USA: American Paging names Dennis Beste CFO.</title>
<headline>American Paging names Dennis Beste CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Paging Inc said it named Dennis Beste to the posts of chief financial officer, treasurer and vice president of finance.</p>
<p>He was previously chief operating officer for Jacobs Trading Co.</p>
<p>Beste replaces Terrence Sullivan, who was named president and chief executive in September after John Schaaf resigned to pursue other interests, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
